{"asset_key":"ep1/herohub_story_11412070","episode":"ep1","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"11412070","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"say:3:1141207001:1":{"text":"Koko, you seem to get along with Patto. Is he aggressive?","source_cn":"卡卡，看起来帕托和你相处很好呢，它凶不凶？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x885C89F70972F42F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1141207002:1":{"text":"Patto is a good bear!","source_cn":"帕托！帕托是好熊！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA7A975FF25973DCE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1141207003:1":{"text":"I found him when he was little! Look how big he's gotten! Patto is bigger than me now!","source_cn":"卡卡见到帕托的时候，帕托很小一只！现在已经很大了！比卡...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1C35D5165177C4F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1141207004:1":{"text":"Sometimes when Patto gets upset, his fur gets dry. I have to water it often!","source_cn":"但是，帕托会不开心，身上的毛，会变干，得经常浇水！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3D1C550BBB5FA9C9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1141207005:1":{"text":"But water is hard to find here...","source_cn":"水，很难找……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA28247D63814929","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:8:1141207005":{"text":"But water is hard to find here...","source_cn":"水，很难找……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA28247D63814929","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1141207006:1":{"text":"Always!","source_cn":"一直！都是！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x48868AC022798192","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1141207007:1":{"text":"Well... People think Patto is scary. And Patto is afraid of others! He only likes Koko and Antandra!","source_cn":"帕托，其他人害怕，帕托也害怕其他人！只喜欢卡卡，还有安...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD771FF834BB46515","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1141207008:1":{"text":"Patto likes playing with boulders over fighting. He's so big and gentle that I cuddle with him every night!","source_cn":"但是，帕托喜欢滚石球，不喜欢打架。晚上靠着睡，软软的大...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF4E6E92583304AE9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1141207009:1":{"text":"Patto deserves more love!","source_cn":"帕托，应该被更多人喜欢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0101EA344360C487","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1141207010:1":{"text":"I'm back with food. Koko, these wanderfruit are for Patto. Do you think it's enough?","source_cn":"我找食物回来了。卡卡，这是帕托喜欢的旅人树果，你看够吃吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x60F6231D59602789","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1141207011:1":{"text":"Whoa! Patto, come and eat!","source_cn":"哇——帕托，有吃的了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8C08AED079605BF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1141207012:1":{"text":"And this meat is for everyone to share. Just have a rest.","source_cn":"还有给大家吃的兽肉，大家休息一下，互相分一分吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAA54F7EA53ECA99E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1141207013:1":{"text":"Thank you, Antandra!","source_cn":"谢谢安丹姐姐！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE0CDAB53361074BC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:8:0:1":{"text":"Has it always just been you two?","source_cn":"一直都是你和帕托吗？","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAA08F4981C99BC12","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Has it always just been you two?","female"